From 65ab01cb0ed30468a26b86e11ab58c94b650cb48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:50:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hid: no controller update before the game's HID resource
 exists

The PS4's pad thread moving a stick while a game boots reached NPad::ControllerUpdate before the
applet resource was set: Captain Toad and Little Kitty, Big City crashed at 6-8 s reading it
through a null pointer (fault address 0x188). Nothing to update yet: return.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01REmpC53sSK3VTcKMxWFSSb
---
 src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp b/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
index 2b04e2c670..231a09e709 100644
--- a/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
+++ b/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
@@ -150,6 +150,12 @@ void NPad::ControllerUpdate(Kernel::KernelCore& kernel, Core::HID::ControllerTri
         return;
     }
 
+    // (PS4 04.34) A controller's change can come before the game's HID resource exists (the
+    // PS4's pad thread moving a stick while a game boots: Captain Toad, Little Kitty, Big City
+    // crashed here at 6-8 s, reading it through a null pointer): nothing to update yet.
+    if (applet_resource_holder.applet_resource == nullptr) {
+        return;
+    }
     for (std::size_t aruid_index = 0; aruid_index < AruidIndexMax; aruid_index++) {
         if (controller_idx >= controller_data[aruid_index].size()) {
             return;
-- 
2.43.0

